<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - TBN - 70,000 tonnes coal Porto Bolivar/Nordenham 1-10/1 $9.00 fio 35,000 shinc/25,000 shinc Kleimar.</p>
<p>Tai Zhou Hai - 40,000 tonnes coke Xingang/Continent 24/12-8/1 $16.95 fio 4,000 shinc/12,000 shin HMM.</p>
<p>United Hope - 65,000 tonnes coal Dalrymple Bay/immingham 5-15/1 $13.25 fio five days shinc NSAC.</p>
</text>
